>> title: Guacamole
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: avocado, lime, mexican, dip, no-cook
>> counters: Taquería, Deli, The Bowl Shop
>> pairs-with: corn-tortillas
>> servings: 6
>> time: 15 min

>> step: mash to a wet paste
Mash @white onion{2%Tbs}(finely chopped), @serrano chile{1}(minced), @cilantro{2%Tbs}(chopped), and @kosher salt{3/4%tsp} to a wet paste in a #molcajete{}.

>> step: mash in, keep it lumpy
Mash @avocados{3%ripe}(Hass) and @lime juice{2%Tbs} into @&(~1)paste{}, leaving it lumpy.

>> step: fold in
Fold @plum tomato{1}(seeded and diced) into @&(~1)guacamole{}.
